# KPacketShield Rule Configuration Template
# Format: ID|ACTION|TYPE|DIRECTION|PROTOCOL|PORT|VALUE|DESC
#
# ACTION: 0 = BLOCK, 1 = PERMIT
# TYPE: 0 = APP, 1 = IP, 2 = PORT
# DIRECTION: 0 = OUTBOUND, 1 = INBOUND, 2 = BOTH
# PROTOCOL: 6 = TCP, 17 = UDP, 0 = ANY
#
# Examples:
# 1|0|0|0|0|0|C:\Windows\System32\curl.exe|Block curl outbound
# 2|0|1|2|0|0|198.51.100.1|Block malicious IP
# 3|0|2|1|6|4444|4444|Block inbound TCP 4444
